# GitHub Account

- Use only the GitHub account `alex-agiventures` in this repository.
- Before any commit or remote Git/GitHub action, run `bun run git:setup-account` and let it fail closed.
- Commits must use `Alex Ivany <alex@agiventures.ca>` as both author and committer.
- `origin` must use `git@github.com-work:AGI-Ventures-Canada/oatmeal.git` for fetch and push.
- `gh api user --jq .login` must return exactly `alex-agiventures` before any `gh` command or push.
- Never use `alexivany`, `alexander.ivany@gmail.com`, the default `github.com` SSH host, or a personal GitHub token for this repo.
- Never bypass the checked-in Git hooks with `--no-verify` or by changing `core.hooksPath`.
- If account verification fails, stop. Do not commit, fetch, pull, push, open or edit a PR, merge, or run another mutating GitHub command.
